    <div class="alert alert-emphasis">
        <h3>🐘 Financial Disclosure</h3>
        <p>
            PostgreSQL Conference 2026 is funded entirely through sponsor contributions and ticket sales.
            No other sources of funding will be used for organizing or delivering the event.
        </p>
        <p>
            To ensure full transparency, a complete financial disclosure will be published on this website after
